----

Instructs the client router to skip view transition animations when the browser is already providing its own visual transition, such as a swipe gesture.

Updates the minimum supported version of VS Code to 1.92.0 (July 2024)

Fixes an issue where `client:only` components could have duplicate `client:component-path` attributes added in MDX in rare cases
Fixes unnecessary prerendering of redirect destinations

Unnecessary files are no longer generated by static builds for redirected routes.

Requests are no longer made at build time to external redirect destination URLs, which could cause builds to fail.

Updates the dependency `svgo` to the latest, to fix a security issue.
